# F-24 §7 · Line endings.
#
# index.html, chat.html, login.html, roi.html and settings.html were committed
# with CR-only (classic Mac) line endings. Git sees such a file as a single
# line, so every diff against one of them was the entire file — which means no
# change to those five files has ever been reviewable. They have been converted
# to LF; this pins them there so an editor cannot quietly convert one back.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.svg text eol=lf
*.sqlite binary
*.sqlite-shm binary
*.sqlite-wal binary
